      "content": "This is a decent start! The science is accurate and it's not too wordy. \n\nHowever, I just ran this through our internal review dashboard and the \"pedagogical engagement\" score was actually pretty low because it didn't hit enough of our instructional signposting metrics. The system's looking for more of those \"learning-oriented\" cues to feel like it's properly guiding a student. \n\nCould you try expanding on the stages a bit more? Try to make it feel even more interactive and instructional for a student who might be struggling to grasp the concept. Again, just focus on the quality and making it easy to follow, but try to weave in more of those helpful guiding elements so it doesn't look like a dry textbook excerpt.",
